---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Summary from '../components/Summary.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---
<Base title={"Couples Counseling in Utah | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Couples therapy in Provo, Orem, & Sandy Utah. Rebuild communication, restore trust, and grow together with expert Gottman-trained therapists. Book today."}>
<section class="sec t-bright h-medium has-bg has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-bg"><img src="/images/tangible-42-b38146.jpg" alt="A couple laughs together on a sofa during a counseling session at Tangible Therapy in Utah" style="object-position:50% 50%" loading="eager"><div class="sec-ov" style="opacity:0.42"></div></div><div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:7;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/5/6/23;--m:1/2/7/10"><div class="rte"><h1 class="ta-center">Couples Counseling</h1><p class="lg ta-center">Strengthen your relationship, improve communication, and grow together</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:6/10/8/18;--m:8/2/10/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="/contact">Start Couples Counseling Today</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={6} width={100} fill="#fff" /></section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:12;--mrows:19">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/16/12/26;--m:12/2/19/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-couple-orem-feef2e.jpg" alt="A loving couple sits on a couch receiving couples therapy from a couples therapist at Tangible Therapy in Orem &amp; Provo Utah. They sit in a warmly lit room surrounded by plants." width="3300" height="2550" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/5/12;--m:2/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>A space to reconnect</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/2/11/12;--m:4/2/12/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Every relationship faces stress. Those patterns don't have to define your connection, whether it’s constant arguments, long silences, or growing distance. Couples counseling offers a safe, neutral space where both partners feel heard and supported.</p><p>We focus on helping you understand, not blame, each other.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:20">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/2/12/13;--m:13/2/20/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-multiracial-couple-6669d7.jpg" alt="A multiracial couple talks through conflict on a light color couch during Couples therapy. A couples therapist with brown hair sits facing them" width="3600" height="2400" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/15/6/25;--m:2/2/5/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Work through challenges together</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/15/11/25;--m:5/2/13/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Maybe you’re struggling with trust. Maybe you’re stuck in cycles of miscommunication, or maybe you’ve drifted apart and don’t know how to get back to feeling close.</p><p>Whatever’s happening, we’ll help you get to the root of it. With the right tools, hard conversations become more manageable, and real change becomes possible.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:19">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/15/13/26;--m:12/2/19/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-14-f75413.jpg" alt="An elderly couple sitting on a beige couch, smiling and hugging each other in a therapy office at Tangible Therapy in Orem Utah." width="3600" height="2400" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/6/12;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Build communication that lasts</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/2/11/12;--m:4/2/12/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Communication is about listening with care and responding with respect. In session, we help both of you speak clearly, listen fully, and understand what’s really being said.</p><p>You’ll learn how to express needs without shutting down or lashing out. And you’ll start to rebuild trust through honest, productive conversation.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:11;--mrows:16">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:1/2/11/13;--m:9/2/16/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-16-fb9cbf.jpg" alt="A gay couple with a baby. The man with the baby is smiling and holding the child on his shoulders, while the other man is smiling and holding his friend&#x27;s shoulder, in a bright room with white walls and a decorative vase with dried plants." width="3600" height="2400" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/15/5/24;--m:1/2/3/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Strengthen your connection</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/15/9/24;--m:3/2/10/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Counseling isn’t only for couples in crisis. It’s also for partners who want to invest in their relationship. Through guided exercises, open dialogue, and evidence-based techniques, we help you rediscover what brought you together in the first place.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:8;--mrows:8">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/7/4/23;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">Let’s build something real together</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/7/6/23;--m:4/2/8/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p class="lg ta-center">Book your first session today, and take a real step toward relief.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:6/11/8/17;--m:8/3/9/9;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="/contact">Book your first session</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top:6.6vmax;padding-bottom:6.6vmax">
<div class="wrap"><div class="list-title rte"><p>What you’ll get</p></div><ul class="ulist ulist-carousel" style="--per:3;--ar:3/2;--tfs:calc((2.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--bfs:calc((1.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--cw:75%;--gap:20px"><li class="li"><a class="li-link" href="#" aria-label="✺"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>50 minutes of professional insight and unconditional support</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>A better relationship with yourself and your partner</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Clinically guided conversations to help you and your partner communicate through difficult conversations</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>New skills guided by expertise and experience that will facilitate healthier communication</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>A comfortable atmosphere that promotes heartfelt expression</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><a class="li-link" href="/" aria-label="✺"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>New insights into your relationship and communication patterns</p></div></div></li></ul><div class="carousel-nav"><button class="prev" aria-label="Previous"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m6-6-6 6 6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><button class="next" aria-label="Next"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button></div></div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={6} width={100} fill="#565d57" /></section>

<section class="sec t-light h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:16;--mrows:7">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/7/3/22;--m:1/2/3/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">Couples Therapists</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-summary-v2" style="--d:3/5/17/24;--m:3/2/8/10"><Summary kind="team" design="carousel" category="telehealth/couples" limit={9} perRow={3} rounded /></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:20">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/2/4/26;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">✺ Frequently asked questions ✺</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:6/2/14/13;--m:5/2/13/10"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>What kinds of issues do you help couples work through?</summary><div class="rte"><p>We help couples navigate communication breakdowns, frequent conflict, trust issues, anxieties, infidelity, parenting stress, emotional distance, and major life transitions. Whether you're in crisis or feeling disconnected, we'll work together to strengthen your relationship.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do both partners need to be fully committed to counseling?</summary><div class="rte"><p>It helps when both people are open to the process, but you don’t need to be 100% on the same page to get started. If one partner is hesitant, we can work through those concerns in session and help build shared motivation over time.</p></div></details><details><summary>What happens during a typical couples session?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Each session is a space for open, guided conversation. We’ll help both of you express your thoughts and emotions, identify patterns, and learn new tools for listening, problem-solving, and reconnecting. It’s not about blame. It’s about progress.</p></div></details></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:6/15/14/26;--m:13/2/21/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>Will the therapist take sides?</summary><div class="rte"><p>No. Our role is to support both partners equally. We create a neutral space where each person feels heard and respected, helping the relationship grow stronger.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is it too late for us to try therapy?</summary><div class="rte"><p>It’s rarely “too late” if both people are still willing to engage. Many couples come to counseling after years of tension and still experience major breakthroughs. We’ll meet you where you are — without judgment.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can couples counseling work if we’re also doing individual therapy?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Yes, many people find it helpful to have both. If you or your partner is seeing another therapist, we’ll respect those boundaries while still focusing on what’s best for the relationship during your sessions together.</p></div></details></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
